        "image_width": 0,
        "image_height": 0,
        "caption": null,
        "footnote": null,
        "table_body": null,
        "content": "BF was the primary researcher. PC contributed with suggestions for the random seeds as a hyper-parameters and label smoothing to speed up training. JH contributed with suggestion for higher dropout throughout the network for more generalization.",
        "title_level": -1
      },
      "summary": ""
    },
